---
layout: base.njk
title: Case Studies – Digital Marketing Performance
permalink: /case-studies/
---
<div class="py-8 md:py-16 reveal-on-scroll">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
    <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2">Detailed Breakdowns</span>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-4">Case Studies</h1>
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 font-body leading-relaxed">
      Detailed documentation of commercial marketing engagements, outlining the core challenge, strategic approach, verified outcomes, and technical architecture.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    {% for cs in collections.caseStudies %}
      <article class="p-8 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#161616] flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-accent/40 transition">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2 font-mono">
            Client Engagement
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-2xl text-white mb-3">
            <a href="{{ cs.url }}" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors">
              {{ cs.data.title }}
            </a>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-body">
            {{ cs.data.excerpt }}
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between">
          <a href="{{ cs.url }}" class="text-xs font-semibold text-accent hover:text-accent-light inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 touch-target">
            Read Case Study &rarr;
          </a>
          <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-mono">Full Breakdown</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
